{"version":1,"content":"<p>楊茜堯、陳豪、陳展鵬、姚子羚、傅嘉莉、鄺潔楹、陳楨怡，今天（1日）現身上水，宣傳無綫台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》，該劇圍繞娛樂圈女明星鬥爭故事，總監製鍾澍佳稱拍攝該劇後，得知娛樂圈的潛規則，大開眼界。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:47.348914+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T12:23:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:38:26.407547+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771179+00:00","content_hash":"9d12b20451fac2ad380c4a34217acf9539ee4b312a01c57a8a8d3295e76c1963","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}